sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Sub as Dept sub-graph
  participant LLM as ChatOpenAI bind_tools
  participant TN as ToolNode
  participant Py as Python tool fn
  participant DB

  Sub->>LLM: messages + tool schemas
  LLM-->>Sub: assistant w/ tool_calls=[reg_check_enrollment_eligibility]
  Sub->>TN: route to tools
  TN->>Py: reg_check_enrollment_eligibility(db student_id CS301)
  Py->>DB: SELECT course / holds / prereqs / grades
  DB-->>Py: rows
  Py-->>TN: dict result
  TN-->>Sub: ToolMessage JSON
  Sub->>LLM: messages now include tool result
  LLM-->>Sub: assistant message no more tool_calls
  Note over Sub: loop ends last message is the answer (may contain ESCALATE)
